    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo><</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>></mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo><</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>  </mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>></mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Graph of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0002_91e86b4b9286.png\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0002_016aa9f365fa.png\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>"
